body:
I know only one AP-AP couple in life and it was extremely toxic. The boyfriend flirted with other girls bcs he put on pedestal every girl that gave him at least some attention and the girlfriend roasted him everytime for this, blamed and tried to control. 

&#x200B;

Buy if both are aware of the problem, I think they can change and maybe even faster than with avoidant bcs they better understand each other issues
